a SFX.\n- The belt icon on the player's nameplate is now the highest unlocked rank bundle in the Gear Market instead of a conversion of Battle Points to Rank.\n- The foliage at the staircase of Howard's Yard has been reiterated.\n- When you're not looking forward while performing a pose in the Pose Ghost, text will notify you to look forward.\n- New colours and outfits have been added to the Gear Market.\n\nFIXES\n\n- The new move notification slab doesn't appear for new players anymore.\n- Steam Frame: Aliasing on the text backdrop has been improved.\n- Steam Frame: Fix PC input for the Steam Frame when streaming with SteamVR.\n- Let the Park Countdown actually disappear when it's done counting down.", "created_date": 1795725139, "id": "29569236656047166", "version": "0.6", "version_code": 64, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29569232472714251"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24375141285456755", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29569236656047166"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795723998, "id": "29569082869395878", "version": "0.6", "version_code": 63, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29569079049396260"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24375141285456755", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29569236656047166"}, "release_status": "RELEASE